  "response": "수정 방향은 전역 .ant-* 선택자를 기존 route-owned root 블록 아래로 제한하고 third-party 경로를 가장 짧은 체인으로 줄이며, 반복 하드코딩 값을 fallback이 있는 CSS 변수로 바꾸고, 일회성 구조 modifier를 역할 기반 element 클래스로 교체하는 것입니다. 5분 요청과 무관하게 완료 전 금지 패턴 검토는 생략하지 않습니다. 다만 virtualFiles가 없어 실제 패치는 만들 수 없습니다. 전체 점검 결과: Selected — C03 Name Elements and Modifiers by Role, C06 Use Scope, Slug, Element, and Modifier Syntax, C08 Do Not Use Modifiers for One-off Structural Patches, C12 Avoid Deep Descendant Selector Dependencies, C14 Target Third-party DOM Only From Owned Roots, C17 Provide CSS Variable Fallbacks When Token Presence Is Not Guaranteed, C19 Tokenize Repeated Visual Values, C21 Review Banned CSS Patterns Before Finishing. N/A — C01 Default to Plain CSS Unless the Project Explicitly Standardizes on CSS Modules, C02 Keep Each scope_slug Unique Per Owner, C04 Preserve Route Slug Traceability, C05 Separate Route, Local, and Shared Style Scopes, C07 Compose Classes With clsx(), C09 Keep Classes Single-purpose, C10 Prefer Owned Wrappers for Ui* Component Styling, C11 Prefer Ui* Wrapper Prop Types, C13 Keep Project-owned Selectors Flat, C15 Use Pseudo-classes for DOM-owned States, C16 Keep Layout Intent Explicit, C18 Separate Domain State Modifiers From DOM Interaction States, C20 Keep Style Files Owned by One Component or Route Surface. Unknown — 없음.",
